Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 480
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 24

Type "cd ~/Desktop/codemap/demo-repo"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "codemap ."
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 500ms

Type "codemap --task 'add retry logic' ."
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 500ms

Type "codemap --get-symbol Engine ."
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 500ms

Type "codemap --explain Engine ."
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 500ms
